    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cardinal Descent is a card building roguelike where you craft elemental synergies and find game breaking sticker combos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master the Elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically play element based cards to pull off combos of your choosing. Play your cards in the right order to maximise damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114100/extras/f664fc72067a323612c2c6fc1778ce2a.poster.avif?t=1750583797\" width=630 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114100/extras/f664fc72067a323612c2c6fc1778ce2a.webm?t=1750583797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114100/extras/f664fc72067a323612c2c6fc1778ce2a.mp4?t=1750583797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Change the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress you unlock game changing stickers that are placed on your cards, find cool synergies and combos as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114100/extras/25c187402b4213c7d96c1fc906b00a1b.poster.avif?t=1750583797\" width=630 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114100/extras/25c187402b4213c7d96c1fc906b00a1b.webm?t=1750583797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114100/extras/25c187402b4213c7d96c1fc906b00a1b.mp4?t=1750583797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Break The Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sticker editing and the shop allow you to craft the perfect synergy to deal insane amounts of damage. Will you break the game? Or will it outpace you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114100/extras/9d8ac37707589f19bc336cc25072a051.poster.avif?t=1750583797\" width=630 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114100/extras/9d8ac37707589f19bc336cc25072a051.webm?t=1750583797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114100/extras/9d8ac37707589f19bc336cc25072a051.mp4?t=1750583797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cardinal Descent is a card building roguelike where you craft elemental synergies and find game breaking sticker combos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master the Elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically play element based cards to pull off combos of your choosing. Play your cards in the right order to maximise damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114100/extras/f664fc72067a323612c2c6fc1778ce2a.poster.avif?t=1750583797\" width=630 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114100/extras/f664fc72067a323612c2c6fc1778ce2a.webm?t=1750583797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114100/extras/f664fc72067a323612c2c6fc1778ce2a.mp4?t=1750583797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Change the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress you unlock game changing stickers that are placed on your cards, find cool synergies and combos as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114100/extras/25c187402b4213c7d96c1fc906b00a1b.poster.avif?t=1750583797\" width=630 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114100/extras/25c187402b4213c7d96c1fc906b00a1b.webm?t=1750583797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114100/extras/25c187402b4213c7d96c1fc906b00a1b.mp4?t=1750583797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Break The Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sticker editing and the shop allow you to craft the perfect synergy to deal insane amounts of damage. Will you break the game? Or will it outpace you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114100/extras/9d8ac37707589f19bc336cc25072a051.poster.avif?t=1750583797\" width=630 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114100/extras/9d8ac37707589f19bc336cc25072a051.webm?t=1750583797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114100/extras/9d8ac37707589f19bc336cc25072a051.mp4?t=1750583797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
